   "heard": "UPSC, fiend twenty-three. General Studies Paper One, ten marks, one hundred and fifty words. Why is the South-West Monsoon called Purvaiya, easterly, in the Bhojpur region? And how has this wind system influenced the region's culture? Here's the puzzle. A South-West Monsoon with an east wind's name."
